{"id":47313,"ord":25,"n_segments":152,"prev":47312,"next":47314,"doc":{"id":"61125","title":"61125_Teddy Bunn oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Theodore Leroy Bunn","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/61125/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=61125"},"chapter":"Spirits of Rhythm and the road in the 1930s","title":"Ben Bernie's Sepia Nephews becomes the Spirits of Rhythm","category":"band_or_employer","summary":"The group started as Ben Bernie's Sepia Nephews in a midtown theater show, later billed as the Spirits of Rhythm and the Five Spirits of Rhythm.","period":"early 1930s","year_from":1930,"year_to":1933,"words":270,"start":[37,0],"end":[39,9],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=61125#s47313","tags":{"places":[{"name":"New York","focus":1,"type":"city"},{"name":"Harlem","focus":0,"type":"neighborhood","in":"New York"},{"name":"Midtown","focus":0,"type":"neighborhood","in":"New York"}],"venues":[{"name":"Onyx Club","focus":0,"city":"New York"}],"bands":[{"name":"Ben Bernie's Sepia Nephews","focus":1,"leader":"Ben Bernie"},{"name":"Spirits of Rhythm","focus":1,"leader":null},{"name":"Five Spirits of Rhythm","focus":1,"leader":null},{"name":"Ben Bernie Orchestra","focus":1,"leader":"Ben Bernie"}]},"people":[{"name":"Ben Bernie","qid":"Q816444","n":9},{"name":"Nephews","qid":null,"n":2}],"story":{"theme":18,"theme_name":"Getting paid: wages, tips and leaving over money","community":39,"community_name":"Battling at the Savoy Ballroom","core":false},"blocks":[{"p":37,"b":0,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Around that same time."},{"p":37,"b":1,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":37,"b":2,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"When did the Spirits first form up? I guess they were the Nephews first, right?"},{"p":37,"b":3,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Ben Burnie's Nephews."},{"p":37,"b":4,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Ben Burnie's Nephews."},{"p":37,"b":5,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":37,"b":6,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Who was Ben Burnie?"},{"p":37,"b":7,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Ben Burnie was a piano player."},{"p":37,"b":8,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":37,"b":9,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"I mean a leader. He was the leader of a band. Ben Burnie."},{"p":37,"b":10,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":37,"b":11,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"And the Sepia Nephews -- we were called the Sepia Nephews."},{"p":37,"b":12,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"So he had a show."},{"p":37,"b":13,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":37,"b":14,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh. A revue, like."},{"p":37,"b":15,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"That's right."},{"p":37,"b":16,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh. And where was that? Was that at the Onyx, or was that somewhere else?"},{"p":37,"b":17,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"That was in New York."},{"p":37,"b":18,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"You don't remember where?"},{"p":37,"b":19,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"I don't know where he was playing then."},{"p":37,"b":20,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"In Harlem?"},{"p":38,"b":0,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"No, not in Harlem. It was very seldom that white bands came to Harlem."},{"p":38,"b":1,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Oh, Ben Burnie was a white band leader."},{"p":38,"b":2,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":38,"b":3,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Oh, yeah?"},{"p":38,"b":4,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"He came out here."},{"p":38,"b":5,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh. So that was probably midtown somewhere, huh?"},{"p":38,"b":6,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. Up in that area."},{"p":38,"b":7,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":38,"b":8,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Boy."},{"p":38,"b":9,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"One of the theaters?"},{"p":38,"b":10,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Huh?"},{"p":38,"b":11,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Was it in a theater?"},{"p":38,"b":12,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":38,"b":13,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"So he had a big show, then, an orchestra."},{"p":38,"b":14,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":38,"b":15,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"And then they used to feature the Nephews."},{"p":38,"b":16,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Featured just the Spirits."},{"p":38,"b":17,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":38,"b":18,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"We used to be the Spirits of Rhythm."},{"p":38,"b":19,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"But first it was the Sepia Nephews,"},{"p":39,"b":0,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Ben Burnie's Sepia Nephews?"},{"p":39,"b":1,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Ben Burnie's Sepia Nephews."},{"p":39,"b":2,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":39,"b":3,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"That's when Ben had us."},{"p":39,"b":4,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh. When was --"},{"p":39,"b":5,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Then we turned around and got into -- what do you call it? Sepia Nephews, and then the other."},{"p":39,"b":6,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"There was the Five --"},{"p":39,"b":7,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"The Five Spirits of Rhythm."},{"p":39,"b":8,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah, the Five Spirits of Rhythm."},{"p":39,"b":9,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"The Five Spirits of Rhythm, because that's when we added a couple of more on."}]}